{"id":"8ce1554622515cdf","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-truth-table.md","title":"Nerode Truth-table 定理","display":"thm-truth-table — Nerode Truth-table 定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-truth-table","aliases":["20-thm-truth-table"],"display":"thm-truth-table — Nerode Truth-table 定理","chapter":"3","section":"3.8","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 3.8.5","source_pdf_pages":[111],"source_printed_pages":[75],"depends_on":["[[20-df-truth-table]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-truth-table"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-truth-table</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-truth-table — Nerode Truth-table 定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.8"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 3.8.5"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>111</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>75</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"202d3cae13e0389b\" href=\"?note=202d3cae13e0389b\" title=\"20-df-truth-table\">20-df-truth-table</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"202d3cae13e0389b\" href=\"?note=202d3cae13e0389b\" title=\"20-df-truth-table\">20-df-truth-table</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\\)</span> 是集合之间的 truth-table 归约关系，见上游 truth-table。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}B\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\ [\\Phi_e^B=\\chi_A\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\forall x\\ \\Phi_e^X(x)\\downarrow\\in2].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}B\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\ [\\Phi_e^B=\\chi_A\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\forall x\\ \\Phi_e^X(x)\\downarrow\\in2].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反向对每个输入枚举产生输出的有限 oracle 前缀，覆盖 Cantor 空间；紧致性给出有限覆盖。有效寻找该覆盖，取最大长度并填写全部行，产生统一可计算真值表。输出非二进制的全泛函也可经固定值变换处理，但这里直接要求集合输出类型。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 3.8.5；印刷页 75；PDF 第 111 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"202d3cae13e0389b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-truth-table]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"202d3cae13e0389b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}B\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\ [\\Phi_e^B=\\chi_A\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\forall x\\ \\Phi_e^X(x)\\downarrow\\in2].","display":true}],"bytes":1335,"backlinks":[{"id":"c4e71acf1bfafb59","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-thm-truth-table]]。"}],"outgoing":["202d3cae13e0389b","140cce30ee9c16d1"]}